# The variables to build, and facts the sources don't give (origin: hand).
# Edited by hand; read by build/build_records.py.
release: {{ release_id | tojson }}
# Who makes the hand-entered judgments in this file (STANDARD.md §3, origin: hand):
# a person, or the agent and its task, e.g. "Claude (PublicDataToolkit Task 35)".
# Never a person who didn't make or check them. If several people or agents add
# entries, name each, and say in a comment which entries are whose. The build
# stops while author is empty and a hand fact is written.
author:
date:
# Start with 30-50 variables that include the hard cases: a battery, an item
# asked on only some forms, several wordings, several kinds of missing codes,
# and anything the publisher has corrected (instructions/03-parse-documentation.md).
variables: {}
